 nPierre-Auguste Renoir is one of the world’s favourite artists\, a foundin
 g member of the Impressionist movement and a constantly evolving artist. W
 ith exclusive access to the National Gallery’s new exciting show of the sa
 me name (3 October 2026 – 31 January 2027)\, Exhibition on Screen will bri
